	"debug",

	"Investigate and fix a ShizoScript problem.",

	[
		[
			name = "problem",
			description = "Description of the problem.",
			required = true
		]
	],

	[](svr, args)
	{
		problem = args.problemtostring();


		return "
Debug the following ShizoScript problem.

First inspect the relevant implementation and documentation.

Determine the actual cause rather than guessing.

Make the smallest appropriate fix.

Verify the fix afterwards.

Problem:

" + problem;
	}
);


